   "version": "Introduced in House",
   "date": "2020-04-07",
   "text": "Emergency Medicaid for Coronavirus Treatment Act\n This bill requires state Medicaid programs to cover individuals who are diagnosed with a disease that is the subject of a declared national emergency, including with respect to ongoing treatment and testing.\n The bill applies retroactively."
